#. §0: `rw`
#. §1: `a - 2b`
#. §2: `h`
#. §3: `a - 2b = b`
#. §4: `rw [h]`
#. §5: `a - 2b`
#. §6: `b`
#. §7: `repeat rw [h]`
#. §8: `h`
#. §9: `a - 2 * (a - 2 * (a - 2b))`
#. §10: `b`
#. §11: `nth_rewrite n [h]`
#. §12: `h`
#. §13: `rw [h] at g`
#. §14: `rw [h]`
#. §15: `g`
#: Game.Theorems.Space.TheoremDocs
msgid "§0 or \"rewrite\" allows you to substitute terms. If you have a goal with the term §1 and a theorem or assumption §2 that §3 then §4 will change every instance of §5 into just §6.\n"
"- §7 will keep rewriting until there is nothing matching §8. §9 will turn into just §10.\n"
"- §11 will only rewrite the nth instance of §12 in your goal.\n"
"- §13 will apply §14 to the hypothosis §15."
msgstr ""

